%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fe2d31c0a575d374f9b00d77d5d88faf, type: 3}
  m_Name: CarriageRide
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSequence
  lines:
  - speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: After putting a stop to this sadistic tradition, you decide it is time
      to go to the next destination.
    backgroundImage: {fileID: 0}
    flashColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    flashFadeInSeconds: 0
    flashHoldSeconds: 0
    flashFadeOutSeconds: 0
  - speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: With the help of Henry, head of Abdul's group, you are granted a free ride
      in one of his carriages.
    backgroundImage: {fileID: 0}
    flashColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    flashFadeInSeconds: 0
    flashHoldSeconds: 0
    flashFadeOutSeconds: 0
  - speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: With the group now one member bigger, you feel confident with tackling
      any challange that comes your way.
    backgroundImage: {fileID: 0}
    flashColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    flashFadeInSeconds: 0
    flashHoldSeconds: 0
    flashFadeOutSeconds: 0
  - speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: At first four strangers, now five, you have a common goal that you want
      to see to the end.
    backgroundImage: {fileID: 0}
    flashColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    flashFadeInSeconds: 0
    flashHoldSeconds: 0
    flashFadeOutSeconds: 0
  - speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: This adventure has made you closer, but work is still to be done. You board
      the carriage and wait for your arrival at EwigenStadt, misty city of DartMund.
    backgroundImage: {fileID: 0}
    flashColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    flashFadeInSeconds: 0
    flashHoldSeconds: 0
    flashFadeOutSeconds: 0
  music: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8304d5d84951d95428ef7af8e3bd4167, type: 3}
